WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:02.945
Your allowance is the first budget you actually run

00:00:03.895 --> 00:00:06.395
This path follows it from the canteen line to

00:00:06.434 --> 00:00:08.579
the messages that try to take it from you

00:00:16.332 --> 00:00:19.292
Every Monday you get 500 pesos for the week

00:00:20.361 --> 00:00:24.361
By Wednesday only 150 pesos is left and there

00:00:24.453 --> 00:00:26.321
are still three school days to go

00:00:34.074 --> 00:00:37.350
Know your daily number before Monday not by Wednesday
